# ============================================================================
# IdealAorta-PINN
# TRACKED: source (idealaorta_pinn/, scripts/, configs/), docs (docs/, README,
#          paper/ incl. curated manuscript figures), and the small generated
#          case index data/registry.json.
# IGNORED (below): raw/processed CFD data, trained checkpoints, run logs, and
#          auto-generated report artifacts — all regenerated by the pipeline
#          (scripts/prepare.py, scripts/run.py).
# ============================================================================

# --- CFD data (large: ~1.1 GB raw + ~0.4 GB processed parquet/npz cache) ---
data/raw/
data/processed/
!data/registry.json            # small JSON case index — keep under version control

# --- Trained models: checkpoints + per-run training artifacts + run logs ---
#     (loss_history.csv / normalizer.json live under models/<run>/; regenerate
#     with scripts/run.py. Share a specific model out-of-band, not via git.)
models/
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.log

# --- Report deliverables: auto-generated from the trained model, regenerable ---
#     Curated figures for the manuscript live in paper/figures/ (tracked).
#     To version one specific artifact, add e.g.  !report/figures/keep_me.png
report/

# --- Legacy (nothing should write here anymore) ---
outputs/
experiments/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
CLAUDE.md

# LaTeX build artifacts (preview wrapper; sources are tracked)
paper/_preview.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.out
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
